491
00:29:37,511 --> 00:29:40,392
<b><font color=#FFFF00>o terno de pele de carneiro,
os sapatos de couro...</font></b>

492
00:29:40,814 --> 00:29:42,765
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Ele se tornou Frank Sinatra.</font></b>

493
00:29:43,884 --> 00:29:47,753
<b><font color=#FFFF00>E todo o resto,
