1461
01:38:24,919 --> 01:38:26,319
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Sim, eu vi.</font></b>

1462
01:38:27,668 --> 01:38:30,901
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Comecei a cantar
com esse homem lindo</font></b>

1463
01:38:30,902 --> 01:38:33,550
